{
  "_comment": [
    "The host accounts a template-bound Process row class runs as, one table",
    "read through both sides of the boundary rather than one list kept per side.",
    "",
    "`resources` is the Zone the resource compiler binds, in the shape",
    "`nixos-modules/lib.nix` reads it. `rows` is what that compiler projects from",
    "it: the binding's own owner reference, declared row name and template, and",
    "the account each of those must resolve to.",
    "",
    "`tests/unit/nix/cases/host-worker-accounts.nix` evaluates the Zone and",
    "asserts the module provisions exactly the accounts this table names, so a",
    "Nix side that composes a different name fails there. The",
    "`every_provisioned_row_class_composes_its_host_account_name` test in",
    "`packages/d2b-core/src/bundle_resolver.rs` runs `template_account` over the",
    "same rows and asserts the same names, so a Rust side that composes a",
    "different name fails there. Neither list is written out twice, so the two",
    "sides cannot agree by accident of two careful copies."
  ],

  "zone": "work",

  "resources": {
    "host-system": { "type": "Host" },
    "acceptance-guest": { "type": "Guest" },

    "volume-local": {
      "type": "Provider",
      "spec": {
        "artifactId": "fixture-provider",
        "config": { "controllerExecutionRef": "Host/host-system" }
      }
    },
    "volume-virtiofs": {
      "type": "Provider",
      "spec": {
        "artifactId": "fixture-provider",
        "config": { "controllerExecutionRef": "Host/host-system" }
      }
    },
    "runtime-cloud-hypervisor": {
      "type": "Provider",
      "spec": {
        "artifactId": "fixture-provider",
        "config": { "controllerExecutionRef": "Host/host-system" }
      }
    },
    "device-tpm": {
      "type": "Provider",
      "spec": {
        "artifactId": "fixture-provider",
        "config": { "controllerExecutionRef": "Host/host-system" }
      }
    },
    "device-gpu": {
      "type": "Provider",
      "spec": {
        "artifactId": "fixture-provider",
        "config": { "controllerExecutionRef": "Host/host-system" }
      }
    },
    "unattached-provider": {
      "type": "Provider",
      "spec": { "artifactId": "fixture-provider" }
    },

    "tpm0": {
      "type": "Device",
      "metadata": { "ownerRef": "Guest/acceptance-guest" },
      "spec": {
        "providerRef": "Provider/device-tpm",
        "deviceClass": "emulated",
        "inventory": { "selector": {} },
        "provider": { "settings": {} }
      }
    },
    "gpu0": {
      "type": "Device",
      "metadata": { "ownerRef": "Guest/acceptance-guest" },
      "spec": {
        "providerRef": "Provider/device-gpu",
        "deviceClass": "physical",
        "inventory": { "selector": { "busClass": "drm", "label": "fixture-gpu0" } },
        "provider": { "settings": { "videoSidecar": true } }
      }
    },
    "gpu1": {
      "type": "Device",
      "metadata": { "ownerRef": "Guest/acceptance-guest" },
      "spec": {
        "providerRef": "Provider/device-gpu",
        "deviceClass": "physical",
        "inventory": { "selector": { "busClass": "drm", "label": "fixture-gpu1" } },
        "provider": { "settings": { "renderNodeOnly": true } }
      }
    }
  },

  "rows": [
    {
      "row": "Process/swtpm-tpm0",
      "owner": "Provider/device-tpm",
      "template": "swtpm-socket",
      "account": "d2b-work-tpm0-swtpm"
    },
    {
      "row": "EphemeralProcess/swtpm-flush-tpm0",
      "owner": "Provider/device-tpm",
      "template": "swtpm-init-flush",
      "account": "d2b-work-tpm0-swtpm-flush"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/gpu-gpu0",
      "owner": "Provider/device-gpu",
      "template": "gpu-worker",
      "account": "d2b-work-gpu0-gpu"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/video-gpu0",
      "owner": "Provider/device-gpu",
      "template": "video-worker",
      "account": "d2b-work-gpu0-video"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/gpu-gpu1",
      "owner": "Provider/device-gpu",
      "template": "gpu-render-node",
      "account": "d2b-work-gpu1-gpu"
    },

    {
      "_comment": "A Provider whose name does not fit with its row class is shortened with a digest of the whole name, so it is still an account the host holds and still distinct from the row class beside it.",
      "row": "Process/controller-9b1c40f2f6a1a1d4e0dd8b6a5b0f7c22",
      "owner": "Provider/volume-local",
      "template": "controller-fixture-provider-volume-controller",
      "account": "d2b-work-controller-vo-632196ce"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/controller-4f0d2c9a1e7b4d8f9a3c5e2b7d01634",
      "owner": "Provider/volume-virtiofs",
      "template": "controller-fixture-provider-volume-controller",
      "account": "d2b-work-controller-vo-4d448bd4"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/controller-77c1e0a5b93d24f68e1a7c05d3b2e891",
      "owner": "Provider/runtime-cloud-hypervisor",
      "template": "controller-fixture-provider-cloud-hypervisor-controller",
      "account": "d2b-work-controller-ru-f0691444"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/controller-2a6d5b90c1e34f7d8b0a2c6e5f419837",
      "owner": "Provider/device-tpm",
      "template": "controller-fixture-provider-device-controller",
      "account": "d2b-work-controller-device-tpm"
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/controller-5e3c8a71d0b24f96a8e1c7039d4b2f56",
      "owner": "Provider/device-gpu",
      "template": "controller-fixture-provider-device-controller",
      "account": "d2b-work-controller-device-gpu"
    },

    {
      "row": "Process/virtiofsd-worker-template-9c568763b46745cfe2fdab47",
      "owner": "Provider/volume-virtiofs",
      "template": "virtiofsd-worker",
      "account": "d2b-work-virtiofsd"
    },

    {
      "_comment": "A row class neither side names: the shared crate may not name the credential agent under the Provider family-knowledge rule, so it has no account on either side and is refused rather than resolved to a name only one of them holds.",
      "row": "Process/d2b-mi-agent-template-guest-acceptance-guest",
      "owner": "Provider/credential-managed-identity",
      "template": "d2b-managed-identity-agent",
      "account": null
    },
    {
      "_comment": "An empty Device is not the family's own vocabulary, so no account is composed for it.",
      "row": "Process/gpu-",
      "owner": "Provider/device-gpu",
      "template": "gpu-worker",
      "account": null
    },
    {
      "row": "EphemeralProcess/swtpm-tpm0",
      "owner": "Provider/device-tpm",
      "template": "swtpm-socket",
      "account": null
    },
    {
      "row": "Process/console",
      "owner": "Provider/runtime-cloud-hypervisor",
      "template": "controller",
      "account": null
    }
  ]
}